{"id":"l91gkga5ih92phiqo5v6sp3ud","title":"城市扩张对热带鸟类多样性的影响","originalTitle":"Why the tropics lose the most birds when cities expand","summary":"研究分析了全球超过10,000种鸟类的数据，发现热带城市中的鸟类多样性比自然区域低3倍，高纬度城市则低约20%。热带城市中特有的生态位专家物种在城市中缺失较多，导致城市化对热带地区鸟类多样性的影响更为显著。研究建议通过增加城市绿地来提高城市生物多样性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-tropics-birds-cities.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T01:30:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T01:44:34.997Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T01:44:34.997Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"78932298-d6de-4405-8859-ac92e101d0de","title":"城市化削弱鸟类全球纬度多样性梯度，热带影响更显著"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"78932298-d6de-4405-8859-ac92e101d0de","title":"城市化削弱鸟类全球纬度多样性梯度，热带影响更显著"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fQy2A1HIJ4dk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}